{"id":415488,"imdb":"tt0424986","en":"The Headmaster","orig":"الناظر","ar":"الناظر","tag":null,"ov":"يدير عاشور، والد صلاح، مدرسته بقسوة وصرامة. بعد وفاة عاشور، يرث صلاح المدرسة ويُوكل إدارتها إلى نائبه سيد. يبذل حسين، المعلم، جهدًا كبيرًا لتوجيه صلاح نحو النجاح في إدارة المدرسة وتحقيق نتائج جيدة، بينما يُعاني صلاح من مشاكل الثقة وحاجته لإثبات نفسه والخروج من تحت عباءة والده. بمساعدة حسين، وحبيبته وفاء، وصديقيه عاطف ولمبي، هل سيتمكن صلاح من إدارة المدرسة على طريقته الخاصة؟","rd":"2000-07-26","rt":122,"g":[35],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Promise Film Production","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["EG"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"EG","d":"2000-07-26"}],"dir":["Sherif Arafa"],"prod":["Magdy Al Hawwary"],"wri":["Sherif Arafa","Ahmed Abdallah"],"mus":["Nabil Ali Maher"],"dop":["Ayman Abu El Makarem"],"cast":[{"n":"Alaa Wali El Din","ch":"Ashoor / Salah / Gawaher","p":"/1G34HEeN3frltSacOZBOiUsjyTN.jpg"},{"n":"Hesham Selim","ch":"Hussien","p":"/mEsLAwETgrWHGwLviulP8TlXclb.jpg"},{"n":"Hasan Hosny","ch":"Mr. Said","p":"/vMG9Carh5bi18v5unk06aYvvKZw.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Helmy","ch":"Atef","p":"/xVhX7ia3ptI43V65Os90gbfgxAe.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Saad","ch":"El Lemby","p":"/zpIK3GYmqDPumneEDf0aqsqxhV1.jpg"},{"n":"Basma","ch":"Wafaa","p":"/uHesQTc5W7cEIzC7LktGX9isl62.jpg"},{"n":"Sami Sarhan","ch":"Mr. Nazmy","p":"/17P2Lq2YEmyQzw8fZfRhN0QwIfZ.jpg"},{"n":"Soliman Eid","ch":"Rasmy","p":"/qz4Ok4BEYspiqoek6Jybu9dMO24.jpg"},{"n":"Hanan ElTaweil","ch":"Miss Enshraah","p":"/stD5Gmjd7piXySYhHQfg9lGhrNy.jpg"},{"n":"Youssef Eid","ch":"Zakaria EL Dardiri","p":"/no3W8JMDXcQufoLrQYs2bPGNdyh.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Youssef","ch":"Atef's Father","p":"/uJIFJ0XmId6OLNfCSVNDza9D4j7.jpg"},{"n":"Hagag Abdel Azim","ch":"Mr. Hossam","p":"/7jCaw613wGCWGvTSJp0YDeSwVmI.jpg"},{"n":"Hatem Gamil","ch":"Wael","p":"/5o7BTrBwamXNNr6kQbiyLlcIcCK.jpg"},{"n":"Husain Abu-Haggag","ch":"Mekha","p":"/hIFQT8rnovXgT5MrgkANCg1eRLL.jpg"},{"n":"Karim Mahmoud Abdel Aziz","ch":"Nabil the loving